# mkdocs documentation
# NOTE: the standard Python .gitignore template ignores /site here, as mkdocs
# builds into it. This project does not use mkdocs, and /site is now the static
# flood-map prototype, so the rule is removed rather than silently swallowing it.
# Reinstate it (as /site/ alongside an mkdocs.yml) if mkdocs is ever adopted.

